            "value" : "Review"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se abre Terminal y pide tu contraseña una sola vez para todas. Terminal necesita el permiso Gestión de apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terminal opens and asks for your password once for all of them. Terminal needs the App Management permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se abre Terminal y pide tu contraseña. Solo se da permiso en la carpeta de la app, no dentro de ella. Si una actualización reemplaza la app, hay que darlo otra vez. Si macOS lo bloquea, activa Terminal en Gestión de apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terminal opens and asks for your password. Permission is given only on the app's folder, not inside it. If an update replaces the app, it has to be given again. If macOS blocks it, turn on Terminal in App Management."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se guardó la configuración en %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The settings were saved to %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se importaron %@. Activa el cambio automático para que se les ponga el icono." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imported %@. Turn on Automatic Switching so their icons get set."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se importaron %@. El cambio automático les pone el icono." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imported %@. Automatic Switching sets their icons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se movieron los ajustes de %@ a su nueva ubicación." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The settings of %@ were moved to its new location."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se pueden cambiar %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld can be changed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se pueden cambiar todas" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All can be changed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se restaura el icono original de todas las apps, se apaga el cambio automático, se abre Terminal para quitar los permisos que Iconos dio a las apps de root (pide tu contraseña), se borran los ajustes y las imágenes propias, e Iconos se mueve a la Papelera y se cierra." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original icon of every app is restored, Automatic Switching is turned off, Terminal opens to remove the permissions Iconos gave to root-owned apps (it asks for your password), the settings and custom images are deleted, and Iconos moves to the Trash and quits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se restauraron %lld apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restored %lld apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se restauró 1 app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restored 1 app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se restauró el icono original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original icon was restored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se sabrá la primera vez que apliques un icono. Si macOS lo pide o lo frena, activa Iconos en Privacidad y seguridad > Gestión de apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll know the first time you apply an icon. If macOS asks or blocks it, turn on Iconos in Privacy & Security > App Management."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se sabrá la primera vez que el agente cambie un icono (por ejemplo al pasar a modo oscuro). Es otro permiso, aparte del de Iconos, y se llama Iconos Agente." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You'll know the first time the agent changes an icon (for example when switching to Dark mode). It's a separate permission from the one for Iconos, and it's called Iconos Agente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
