        }
      }
    },
    "macOS protege las apps instaladas: para cambiar sus iconos, Iconos necesita unos permisos. Cada paso dice si ya está listo." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS protects installed apps: to change their icons, Iconos needs a few permissions. Each step shows whether it's ready."
